\begin{highlights}
\item With modeled brain noise, a dense OPM array has higher detectability than SQUID MEG
\item The dense-array advantage is as large as the model's error in SQUID detectability
\item Which system has the higher SNR depends on OPM noise, array design and SNR measure
\item In scaled and template heads, the extra OPM advantage largely reflects helmet fit
